# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to transpile a [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") to a standard [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). It continues with the same time evolution example from the [fermionic circuits guide](circuit#fermionic-circuit-explanation).\n"
msgstr "Este guia explica como transpilar um [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") para um [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) padrão. Ele continua com o mesmo exemplo de evolução temporal do [guia de circuitos fermiônicos](circuit#fermionic-circuit-explanation).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation stages {#transpilation-stages}"
msgstr "Estágios da transpilação {#transpilation-stages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As explained in [`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\"), the preset pass managers in this project split the transpilation into the following stages:\n"
msgstr "Como explicado em [`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\"), os gerenciadores de passagens predefinidos neste projeto dividem a transpilação nos seguintes estágios:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Input** {#input}"
msgstr "**Entrada** {#input}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the input circuit to a directed acyclic graph (DAG) data structure.\n"
msgstr "Converte o circuito de entrada em uma estrutura de dados de grafo acíclico dirigido (DAG).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Optimization** {#optimization}"
msgstr "**Otimização** {#optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keeps the circuit in fermionic space. These passes use fermionic structure and commutation relations while problem-aware knowledge remains fully available. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") is the pass that Trotterizes an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate here, with a product formula or with [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\"), and [`QDriftTrotterization`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-q-drift-trotterization#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization\") its occupation-aware variant; see [Optimization Passes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes#qiskit-fermions-transpiler-passes-optimization) for the full set and [Synthesize an Evolution gate in fermionic space](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation) for how a product formula is chosen.\n"
msgstr "Mantém o circuito no espaço fermiônico. Essas passagens usam a estrutura fermiônica e as relações de comutação enquanto o conhecimento específico do problema permanece totalmente disponível. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") é a passagem que trotteriza aqui uma porta [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\"), com uma fórmula de produto ou com [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\"), e [`QDriftTrotterization`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-q-drift-trotterization#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization\") é sua variante com reconhecimento de ocupação; veja [Passagens de otimização](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes#qiskit-fermions-transpiler-passes-optimization) para o conjunto completo e [Sintetize uma porta Evolution no espaço fermiônico](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation) para saber como uma fórmula de produto é escolhida.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Layout** {#layout}"
msgstr "**Disposição** {#layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maps fermionic mode registers to quantum registers. For occupation-basis mappings like Jordan-Wigner, each fermionic mode maps to a single qubit. This stage also supports more general mappings where the number of qubits differs from the number of fermionic modes.\n"
msgstr "Mapeia registradores de modos fermiônicos para registradores quânticos. Para mapeamentos na base de ocupação como Jordan-Wigner, cada modo fermiônico é mapeado para um único qubit. Esse estágio também oferece suporte a mapeamentos mais gerais em que o número de qubits difere do número de modos fermiônicos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Synthesis** {#synthesis}"
msgstr "**Síntese** {#synthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts fermionic gates to qubit operations by using the chosen fermion-to-qubit mapping. [`FermionicGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-gate#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate\") instances are transformed into sequences of standard quantum gates. A barrier is carried through onto every qubit of each register it touched, so it continues to separate the gates on either side of it during the qubit stage.\n"
msgstr "Converte portas fermiônicas em operações de qubit usando o mapeamento férmion-para-qubit escolhido. As instâncias de [`FermionicGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-gate#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate\") são transformadas em sequências de portas quânticas padrão. Uma barreira é levada para cada qubit de cada registrador que ela tocou, de modo que continue separando as portas de cada lado dela durante o estágio de qubits.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qubit** {#qubit}"
msgstr "**Qubit** {#qubit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiles the resulting qubit circuit by using standard Qiskit methods, including optimization, layout, and routing for your target hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpila o circuito de qubits resultante usando métodos padrão do Qiskit, incluindo otimização, layout e roteamento para o seu hardware alvo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Output** {#output}"
msgstr "**Saída** {#output}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the internal DAG data structure to the desired output format.\n"
msgstr "Converte a estrutura de dados DAG interna para o formato de saída desejado.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "A practical example: transpilation using Jordan-Wigner {#a-practical-example-transpilation-using-jordan-wigner}"
msgstr "Um exemplo prático: transpilação usando Jordan-Wigner {#a-practical-example-transpilation-using-jordan-wigner}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the preset pass manager to transpile your fermionic circuit with the Jordan-Wigner fermion-to-qubit mapping:\n"
msgstr "Use o gerenciador de passagens predefinido para transpilar seu circuito fermiônico com o mapeamento férmion-para-qubit de Jordan-Wigner:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.circuit import FermionicCircuit\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.circuit.library import Evolution\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.operators import FermionOperator, cre, ann\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets import generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Create the same fermionic circuit from the previous guide\n"
"    >>> circuit = FermionicCircuit(4)\n"
"    >>> hamiltonian = FermionOperator.from_terms([\n"
"    ...     ([cre(0), ann(2)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(2), ann(0)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(1), ann(3)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(3), ann(1)], 0.5),\n"
"    ... ])\n"
"    >>> hamiltonian.groups = [0, 0, 1, 1]\n"
"    >>> evolution = Evolution(4, hamiltonian, time=1.0)\n"
"    >>> circuit.append(evolution, circuit.register)\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Generate the Jordan-Wigner transpilation pipeline\n"
"    >>> pm = generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Transpile the fermionic circuit to a qubit circuit\n"
"    >>> qubit_circuit = pm.run(circuit)\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # The result is a standard QuantumCircuit\n"
"    >>> print(type(qubit_circuit))\n"
"    <class 'qiskit.circuit.quantumcircuit.QuantumCircuit'>\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

